        "Time limit: 6 sec; Memory limit: 1024 MiB; Constraints: 2 \\leq N \\leq 150; N - 1 \\leq M \\leq \\min\\left(\\frac{C N (N-1)}{2}, 5 \\times 10^5\\right); 1 \\leq C \\leq 300; 1 \\leq A_i \\leq N-1; \\sum_{i=1}^C A_i \\leq 300; 1 \\leq u_i < v_i \\leq N; 1 \\leq c_i \\leq C; If i \\neq j, then (u_i, v_i, c_i) \\neq (u_j, v_j, c_j); The given graph is connected.; All input values are integers."
